      {
        "id": 233518,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-22T12:09:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I tend to find there's an optimal stance for each character, barring damage type matchups. My custom character is good at drawing aggro, for instance, so I always want her to rush up and punch dudes instead of switching on her healing.</p>\n<p>Also, I'm surprised you ever switch out of Turret Mode. XD The only reason I would is to reposition him!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
