        "raw": "<p>I tend to find there's an optimal stance for each character, barring damage type matchups. My custom character is good at drawing aggro, for instance, so I always want her to rush up and punch dudes instead of switching on her healing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, I'm surprised you ever switch out of Turret Mode. XD The only reason I would is to reposition him!</p>",
